        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is threatened by an alien force and bombarded with asteroids. You are the last hope to save the earth. Will you accept the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend Earth against alien asteroid attacks in this arcade shooter and experience the evolution of the genre in a gripping visual and auditory adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight, Defend, Fail, Upgrade, Repeat and Strike Back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game is a classic arcade space shooter with roguelike elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your ship is destroyed, you can permanently upgrade it, provided you have collected enough alien tech. With each upgrade, the visuals evolve too – from 2-bit black and white, through retro styles, all the way to modern graphics – letting you relive the history of shooter visuals.<br><br>Includes modding support – replace graphics and share your creations.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is threatened by an alien force and bombarded with asteroids. You are the last hope to save the earth. Will you accept the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend Earth against alien asteroid attacks in this arcade shooter and experience the evolution of the genre in a gripping visual and auditory adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight, Defend, Fail, Upgrade, Repeat and Strike Back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game is a classic arcade space shooter with roguelike elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your ship is destroyed, you can permanently upgrade it, provided you have collected enough alien tech. With each upgrade, the visuals evolve too – from 2-bit black and white, through retro styles, all the way to modern graphics – letting you relive the history of shooter visuals.<br><br>Includes modding support – replace graphics and share your creations.</p>",
        "short_description": "Defend Earth against alien asteroid attacks in this arcade roguelite retro shooter and experience the evolution of the genre in a gripping visual and auditory adventure.",
